  <h1>Supply</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">The law of supply, non-price determinants, and shifts of the supply curve.</p>
</div>

<div class="learning-goals">
  <div class="learning-goals-title">You should be able to</div>
  <ul>
    <li>Define supply and state the law of supply</li>
    <li>Draw a supply curve and explain movements along it</li>
    <li>Identify non-price determinants of supply and explain how each shifts the curve</li>
    <li>Distinguish competitive supply from joint supply</li>
    <li>Explain the law of diminishing marginal returns and its link to marginal cost <span class="hl-badge">HL</span></li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="tabs">
  <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab(this,'notes-2-2')">Notes</button>
  <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab(this,'practice-2-2')">Practice</button>
